% A full NP is followed by another nominal phrase with the same referent; the
% construction introduces a two-place 'appos' relation between the two
% instances.
%
% ERS fingerprint (https://delph-in.github.io/docs/erg/ErgSemantics_Apposition/):
%   appos[ARG1 x1, ARG2 x2]
%   [ARG0 x1]
%   [ARG0 x2]

pattern { A [pred="appos"]; A -[1=ARG1]-> X; A -[1=ARG2]-> Y }
